**The [[Lord of Storms]], the [[Eternal Blazing Sun]] and the [[God of Knowledge and Wisdom]] had great disputes
** The [[Earth Mother]]'s attitude was ambiguous, though "She" was slightly leaned towards the [[God of Combat]].
