*After the fall of the Blood Emperor, Angel Families under the Tudor Empire declined.<ref>{{Cite Book|1|60}}</ref>
**[[Zaratul Senior|The ancestor of the Zaratul Family]] was killed by the Half-Fool [[Antigonus]] and [[Bethel Abraham]].<ref name="C1104">{{Cite Book|1|1104}}</ref>
**[[Bethel Abraham]] was banished by the [[Evernight Goddess]] and the [[Lord of Storms]].<ref name="C1104" /> The remaining High-Sequence Beyonders in the family all perished.<ref name="C336">{{Cite Book|1|336}}</ref>
