**[[God of Steam and Machinery|God of Craftsmanship]] did not digest the sequence 1 potion well before promoting to sequence 0 for various reasons. Thus "He" was also the weakest God of the seven Orthodox Gods.<ref name="C1377">{{Cite Book|1|1377}}</ref> "His" birth is related to the [[Moses Ascetic Order]].<ref name="RedditInterview">[https://www.reddit.com/r/LordofTheMysteries/comments/h8tm5y/we_interviewed_the_og_lord_of_the_mysteries/ We Interviewed the OG Lord of The Mysteries Himself]</ref>
**The revival of the [[Hidden Sage]] is related to the relationship between the [[Moses Ascetic Order]] and the God of Craftsmanship of the Fourth Epoch.<ref name="RedditInterview" />
