*[[Salinger|Death]] went mad from attempting to accommodate the [[Uniqueness]] of [[Red Priest Pathway]] with the help of the [[River of Eternal Darkness]].<ref name="C217">{{Cite Book|1|217}}</ref><ref name="C1369">{{Cite Book|1|1369}}</ref>
